/// M41 LIFE-012 TestLinuxInstalledArtifactSmoke
/// example plus build shape.
/// Source: tests/integration/
/// linux_distribution_test.go symbol
/// TestLinuxInstalledArtifactSmoke
/// (L24-259 plus helper L306-325):
/// stage four examples, assert plus run
/// each with wanted bytes, seed
/// sqlite through the installed sidecar,
/// then rebuild twice and require one
/// stable build id.
/// Disposition: migrate (same row pact as
/// the base slice; this file owns the
/// example plus build spellings and
/// tallies only).
/// Protects (this file): facet three
/// (Installed process/files/crypto/SQLite
/// examples assert and run; SQLite build
/// identity stable): the four example
/// names, the five wanted run bytes, the
/// assert plus run guard notes, the
/// assert list field, the three sqlite
/// paths, the two sqlite notes, the two
/// build fields, the build plus rebuild
/// notes, the done note, the two env
/// gate notes, the cut-off path, the
/// timeout call, and the six tallies.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source
/// lines): name pins hold example names;
/// want pins hold wanted run bytes (with
/// quoting as in source); note pins hold
/// guard plus done lines; field pins
/// hold report field names; rel pins
/// hold staged file paths; call pins
/// hold call spellings; count pins hold
/// ints tallied from the leg lists.
/// example-process pins process
/// (L215-217); example-files pins files
/// (L176, L180, L219-220, L225);
/// example-crypto pins crypto
/// (L227-230); example-sqlite pins
/// sqlite (L232-253); want-process-ok
/// pins "ok" (L217); want-files-list
/// pins "file a.txt\n" raw (L225);
/// want-crypto-match pins "match" (L229);
/// want-crypto-mismatch pins "mismatch"
/// (L230); want-sqlite-row pins
/// "7: remember" (L250); assert-note pins
/// the assert line (L196);
/// assert-report-note pins the invalid
/// line (L203); run-note pins the run
/// line (L211); assert-field-list pins
/// json:"assertions" (L200);
/// sqlite-driver-rel pins
/// tests/integration/testdata/sql/
/// sqlite-driver.ts (L236);
/// sqlite-seed-rel pins
/// tests/integration/testdata/sql/
/// sqlite-seed.sql (L237); smoke-seed-rel
/// pins distribution/linux/smoke/
/// sqlite-seed.ts (L244); sqlite-note-setup
/// pins the setup line (L241);
/// sqlite-note-seed pins the seed line
/// (L248); build-field-id pins
/// json:"buildID" (L318); build-field-dir
/// pins json:"directory" (L319);
/// build-report-note pins the invalid
/// line (L323); rebuild-note pins the
/// drifted line (L255); smoke-done-note
/// pins the done line (L258);
/// env-skip-linux pins the linux gate
/// line (L26); env-archive-note pins the
/// archive gate line (L30); cutoff-path
/// pins PATH=/nonexistent (L67, L239,
/// L246, L312; also L287 outside);
/// timeout-call pins 50*time.Minute
/// (L36); example-count pins int (4)
/// from L215-233; assert-leg-count pins
/// int (4) from L216-233; run-leg-count
/// pins int (5) from L217-250;
/// build-repeat-count pins int (2) from
/// L252-253; timeout-minutes pins int
/// (50) from L36; skip-guard-count pins
/// int (2) from L26-30.
/// Facet map (pin order): example-process,
/// example-files, example-crypto,
/// example-sqlite, want-process-ok,
/// want-files-list, want-crypto-match,
/// want-crypto-mismatch, want-sqlite-row,
/// assert-note, assert-report-note,
/// run-note, assert-field-list,
/// sqlite-driver-rel, sqlite-seed-rel,
/// smoke-seed-rel, sqlite-note-setup,
/// sqlite-note-seed, build-field-id,
/// build-field-dir, build-report-note,
/// rebuild-note, smoke-done-note,
/// env-skip-linux, env-archive-note,
/// cutoff-path, timeout-call,
/// example-count, assert-leg-count,
/// run-leg-count, build-repeat-count,
/// timeout-minutes, skip-guard-count.
/// The install plus identity legs live in
/// life-012-base-semantics.can; the
/// qualification legs live in
/// life-012-roots-green.can.
/// Variants: process/files/crypto
/// match-plus-mismatch/sqlite legs plus
/// native qualification when python is
/// present; default plus seeded drifts
/// only here.
/// Environment: linux amd64 plus
/// CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE (row lists two gates;
/// bind at P23; no live run now).
/// Logical gates ARCHIVE plus DB bind at
/// P23; no live run now.
/// Timeout 120000ms is the offline default
/// bound (the live fifty minute hold is
/// pinned above; binds at P23 like the
/// M31 no-run rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (P23
/// plus QD1 plus QN1 accept gates unmet).
/// Case life/installed-smoke-run
/// checks: example-process,
/// example-files, example-crypto,
/// example-sqlite, want-process-ok,
/// want-files-list, want-crypto-match,
/// want-crypto-mismatch, want-sqlite-row,
/// assert-note, assert-report-note,
/// run-note, assert-field-list,
/// sqlite-driver-rel, sqlite-seed-rel,
/// smoke-seed-rel, sqlite-note-setup,
/// sqlite-note-seed, build-field-id,
/// build-field-dir, build-report-note,
